  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NATURA Shea Processing and Marketing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Shea processing.Beneficiaries: 1400 women suppliers.Description: The grant will enable Natura to improve its production infrastructure and equipment and work with its suppliers to improve raw material quality to increase its production and product quality to better meet demand from its American buyer. Funds will also be used to obtain necessary European certifications to target new markets. It will also provide funds to increase its advertising to target national and subregional markets for expansion.</narrative>
  </description>
